 "why": "THE SHIRT THAT IS NOT CLOTH IS IN THE GRAVEYARD (Paolo 9/23: 'WTF IS THIS DOGSHIT'; rule 32(g) names it). DUST PLAID HIDE and BLUE HIDE JEANS are removed from the wardrobe along with their two ramps, so the baseline SHRINKS 332 -> 330. Nobody ever wore them: they were registered in VOTE and never wired, so no body in the game changes. Post-mortem records/BOHEMIA_GRAVEYARD_THE_SHIRT_THAT_IS_NOT_CLOTH_9_24_26.md. NOTE, CARRIED FORWARD FROM THE LAST BAKE AND STILL TRUE: every one of the 330 silhouettes still carries the +15 opaque pixels that arrived at PORTRAIT's eye commit 79ae65d. It is absorbed, not fixed, and not explained.",
